luci-app-wloc includes a clean-room Apple WLOC protobuf transformer and TLS
proxy design derived in part from:

  wificalling-location-gateway
  Copyright (c) 2026 smthdagg
  https://github.com/smthdagg/wificalling-location-gateway
  Audited commit: 5f60c4ded3a44d890efd1a1b8491cce9c54af477
  License: MIT (preserved in LICENSES/wificalling-location-gateway-MIT.txt)

No Wi-Fi Calling Gateway, ePDG, UDP 500/4500, carrier, sing-box node binding,
or call-monitoring implementation is included.

Response-patching behavior was cross-checked against the publicly observable
protocol behavior documented and implemented by:

  Yu9191/wloc
  https://github.com/Yu9191/wloc
  Audited commit: 782e9c5cadf215263d9d168314113e47baaa302c
  Upstream license: AGPL-3.0

No Yu9191/wloc source code is included or copied. The compatible behavior is
independently implemented with this project's existing Rust protobuf parser:
forward to Apple, modify only existing latitude/longitude fields, preserve the
real accuracy and every other response field.
